# Radiation-table build artifacts.  The per-column ExoColumn cache is ~48 KB
# per grid point (a CH4-resolved table has thousands), and the build log is a
# progress trace; both are reproducible from the table itself.  Note the
# tables themselves are deliberately NOT ignored here: the small ones are
# tracked.  A CH4-resolved table is ~45 MB, which is past what belongs in git.
model/radiation/*.h5.cache/
model/radiation/build_*.log

# Scratch runs from tools/calibrate_earth.py (resume cache).
calibrate_earth_runs/
